      "notes": "Add tunnel configuration and timing/word/metadata support; correct Chat/Responses/refusal/tool/image behavior. Reviewed published upstream delta: @ai-sdk/openai 4.0.106 to 4.0.111. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning packages plus the complete local facade; 3,965 reported tests and 33 explicit live skips); node Scripts/sdk.mjs dev test; node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); core/provider isolation and version resolution; 52 deterministic package exports, 106 catalog consumers and four additional exact retained-minimum graphs; docs-site install/check/build (100 pages); git diff --check. No paid live-service calls were run. The publication pipeline requires successful Swift 6.3.3 CI at the exact canonical source before publishing.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native functionality under the project convention. Existing call sites and exact old selectors are retained. Direct minimums change only for concrete API use or required inherited behavior. Version-delta review does not establish full-package parity or live-service acceptance. Updated direct ranges: swift-ai-core 1.2.0 to 1.3.0, swift-ai-openai-compatible 1.1.0 to 1.2.0."
    }
